GIVEN `the index is at all times kept available for inspection at the same place as the register` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 810(4) the index is kept as the subsection requires` MEANS
    IF `the index is at all times kept available for inspection at the same place as the register`
    THEN JUST TRUE
    ELSE JUST FALSE -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "The index must be at all times kept available for inspection at the same place as the register."

