@ref s 810(5)(b) Associated index (src:10963-10963)
GIVEN `default is made in complying with section 810` IS A BOOLEAN
      `s 1121 the officer is in default` IS A MAYBE BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 810(5)(b) the officer of the company commits an offence` MEANS
    IF `default is made in complying with section 810`
